attribute [local instance] HasDerivedCategory.standard

section

variable {A : Type u} [CommRing A] {r : ℕ}

local notation "DMod" => DerivedCategory (ModuleCat A)

/- Domain-style sampling:
- primary domain: commutative algebra and homological algebra of the powered Koszul tower and its
  quotient tower;
- sampled owner declarations:
  `koszulComplex`,
  `KoszulComplex.map`,
  `CategoryTheory.Functor.ofOpSequence`,
  `ChainComplex.isoHomologyι₀`;
- best owner abstraction: the source-facing owners in this file are the powered Koszul and
  quotient inverse systems, built from the canonical chain-complex owner `koszulComplex` and its
  map owner `KoszulComplex.map`;
- primitive data: the diagonal step linear map on `Fin r → A`, the powered ideals, and the
  quotient transition maps;
- derived API: the sequential inverse systems, the augmentation chain maps, and the zeroth
  homology comparison to the quotient stage.

Source/core/bridge triage:
- `source-facing`: the powered Koszul tower, the powered quotient tower, and the canonical
  comparison from zeroth homology to the quotient stage;
- `core/canonical`: `koszulComplex`, `KoszulComplex.map`, `Functor.ofOpSequence`,
